For simplicity and to satisfy "playback state is visible via a non-colour indicator", I'll track local component state: on click, set 'playing', schedule reset when done (using the same timing). But timing duplication in UI is ugly. Alternatively audioEngine exposes `onPlaybackChange` callback setter. Let me add:

